{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1524484-multi-attribute-charm-tree-ideas","id":1524484,"title":"Multi-Attribute Charm Tree ideas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-24T11:49:09-07:00","id":1524484,"title":"Multi-Attribute Charm Tree ideas?","content":"I am playing an Exigent in an alternate Creation game and was looking for help brainstorming some ideas for charms. The exigent is attribute based with Perception, Dexterity, and Manipulation being caste attributes and Appearance being favored. My character initially was a casteless Lunar focusing on the same attributes, but has since turned into an exigent due to the story that is essentially a Celestial version of a water dragonblood.<br /> <br /> As I am essence 3 and about to hit 4 I liked the idea of really cool or flashy charms in one attribute, that then get modified by the other 3 while maintaining a water or Lunar-ish theme. Thw only idea I have come up is an Appearance charm that lets me make 1-health level copies of myself that maintain my stats, but no motes. And then with perception I can see through them, Dexterity I could retroactively switch places with one, and Manipulation I have no clue.<br /> <br /> So I was wondering if anyone else has ideas or thoughts on the matter as I try to brainstorm some more charm ideas. I don't really need mechanics, but welcome them. Just would like some help on more concepts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25616-mcmuffinfluffin","name":"mcmuffinfluffin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}